<title>THAILAND: Thai April c/a deficit widens to 38.0 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai April c/a deficit widens to 38.0 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's April current account deficit widened to a preliminary 38.0 billion baht from 15.9 billion baht deficit in March, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	  April 97    March 97	April 96</p>
<p>				  38.0	 15.9	    49.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 6520642</p>
</text>
